Error [E0001]: `\0` isn't an escape Jet knows
  --> tests/ui/typed_head_path_invalid.jet:2:24
    |
  2 |     value :: Path.{"bad\0path"}
    |                        ^^
 Why: inside quoted text, `\` starts an escape: `\n` (new line), `\t` (tab), `\"` (quote), `\\` (backslash)
 Fix: write `\\` for a real backslash
